!</d> As soon as he finishes speaking the word \"close\", his lips meet, closing his mouth completely, and his speaking motion stops. He leans his head back against the cold wall with a look of immense relief.\n\noverall_soundscape: The chaotic, overwhelming noise of the battle fills the first half, featuring continuous, sharp blaster reports, the distinctive humming and crackling of Luke Skywalker’s lightsaber deflecting bolts, and distant explosions. After the cut, the sound transitions abruptly to a relative quiet behind cover, dominated by the Stormtrooper’s heavy, raspy panting inside the helmet, followed by the specific mechanical click and hiss of the helmet seals releasing, a deep intake of breath, and Robert Downey Jr.'s voice, before ending with softer, calmer breathing.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A",4,5,1344,768,556589502035082,"MinimaxH3\\minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_w4a8_mixed.safetensors","MinimaxH3\\Qwen3-VL-32B-Ultra-Heretic-H3-L0-49-Q4_K_M.gguf","MinimaxH3\\minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors","MinimaxH3\\minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors"]}],"links":[[241,125,0,105,5,"INT"],[248,128,0,129,0,"IMAGE"],[255,105,1,131,1,"AUDIO"],[258,105,0,132,0,"IMAGE"],[259,132,0,131,0,"IMAGE"],[264,115,0,105,3,"INT"],[265,115,1,105,4,"INT"]],"groups":[],"definitions":{"subgraphs":[{"id":"4c314f31-ecda-4b08-ae98-faaba1bf613f","version":1,"state":{"lastGroupId":4,"lastNodeId":140,"lastLinkId":277,"lastRerouteId":0},"revision":0,"config":{},"name":"Image to Video (MiniMax H3)","inputNode":{"id":-10,"bounding":[-2560,4720,128,288]},"outputNode":{"id":-20,"bounding":[670,4780,128,88]},"inputs":[{"id":"d7302ca7-24ed-44c4-8ac9-736540dab7fb","name":"prompt","type":"STRING","linkIds":[197],"pos":[-2456,4744]},{"id":"a304c7c6-8333-47a7-bbdb-423aaa4a06d4","name":"steps","type":"INT","linkIds":[244],"pos":[-2456,4764]},{"id":"a40e5e96-4307-4a8e-a4f8-13a27d4bc9d3","name":"value_1","type":"FLOAT","linkIds":[206],"label":"duration","pos":[-2456,4784]},{"id":"709e2d94-3172-4